Package: nflflights
Title: NFL Team Charter Flight Data Pipeline
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Stephan", "Teodosescu", email = "steodose@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Scrapes, normalizes and enriches NFL team charter flight schedules
    published on blog.jettip.net, producing a single flat CSV that powers a
    Tableau Public dashboard.
